{"id": "hall-campaign-gifts-and-gasoline-records", "title": "Tony Hall’s campaign paid for gifts to his daughters", "seconds": 41.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "831474a4cd0c9fed", "words": 121, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In 2004, Tony Hall bought purses for his daughters.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.05, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["A", "campaign", "purchase"], "sub": "San Francisco, 2004"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.37, 0.74, 1.59, 2.0, 2.21, 2.45, 2.91, 3.06, 3.19]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "He paid with campaign money.", "t0": 4.17, "t1": 5.48, "shot": "r0-part1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "He paid with campaign money"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.42, 0.58, 1.01]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The committee reported the $320.36 purchase as an office expense.", "t0": 5.6, "t1": 11.08, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$320.36", "label": "Gifts for Hall’s daughters"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.51, 0.98, 1.13, 1.42, 1.7, 1.96, 2.36, 2.5, 3.02, 3.36, 3.95, 4.16, 4.29, 4.63]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Almost three years passed before Hall repaid the committee.", "t0": 11.3, "t1": 14.05, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "Hearing order", "text": "campaign committee", "mark": "committee"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.58, 0.84, 1.24, 1.59, 1.84, 2.23, 2.34]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "He reimbursed it shortly before his February 2007 deposition.", "t0": 14.17, "t1": 17.9, "shot": "r2-part1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "He reimbursed it shortly before his February 2007 deposition"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.75, 0.87, 1.2, 1.56, 1.72, 2.21, 2.39, 2.8, 3.09]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Commission also examined 30 gasoline transactions.", "t0": 18.02, "t1": 21.19, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "30", "label": "Gasoline transactions"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.51, 0.81, 1.25, 1.59, 2.09]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The record did not establish how much gasoline was used for a campaign purpose.", "t0": 21.31, "t1": 25.28, "shot": "r3-more1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The record did not establish how much gasoline was used for a campaign purpose"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.44, 0.62, 0.81, 1.34, 1.45, 1.66, 2.17, 2.35, 2.59, 2.74, 2.82, 3.33]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "It found the committee failed to keep adequate records.", "t0": 25.4, "t1": 27.89, "shot": "r3-part1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "It found the committee failed to keep adequate records"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.44, 0.54, 0.9, 1.22, 1.31, 1.54, 1.95]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The records violation drew a $5,000 penalty.", "t0": 28.11, "t1": 30.92, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$6,000", "label": "Fine ordered"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.51, 1.09, 1.28, 1.37, 1.65, 2.01, 2.33]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The personal purchase drew another $1,000.", "t0": 31.04, "t1": 33.53, "shot": "r4-part1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The personal purchase drew another $1,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.57, 0.97, 1.19, 1.51, 1.67, 2.01]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Commission rejected a separate allegation about a $12,000 personal loan.", "t0": 33.65, "t1": 38.23, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "Finding 48", "text": "no violation", "mark": "violation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.69, 1.18, 1.33, 1.71, 2.37, 2.65, 2.72, 3.04, 3.41, 3.75, 4.18]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 38.35, "t1": 40.72, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The campaign purchase", "b": "The money returned", "o": "The hearing order"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "timeline"}